        "除以 $u^k$，每一項剛好是一個次方："
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\frac{A_1}{x-a}+\\frac{A_2}{(x-a)^2}+\\cdots+\\frac{A_k}{(x-a)^k}",
        "P=c_0+c_1u+\\cdots+c_{k-1}u^{k-1}",
        "\\frac{P}{u^k}=\\frac{c_0}{u^k}+\\frac{c_1}{u^{k-1}}+\\cdots+\\frac{c_{k-1}}{u}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 求係數：代根＋比較係數",
      "body": [
        "設（$x$ 一項，$(x+1)^2$ 兩項）：",
        "去分母：",
        "代根：",
        "• $x=0$：$1=A$，$A=1$",
        "• $x=-1$：$1=-C$，$C=-1$",
        "只有兩個根，$B$ 代不出來",
        "補：比較 $x^2$ 係數：$0=A+B$，$B=-1$",
        "或代別的值，例如 $x=1$：$1=4A+2B+C=3+2B$，一樣 $B=-1$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int\\frac{1}{x(x+1)^2}\\,dx",
        "\\frac{1}{x(x+1)^2}=\\frac{A}{x}+\\frac{B}{x+1}+\\frac{C}{(x+1)^2}",
        "1=A(x+1)^2+Bx(x+1)+Cx"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 結果與驗算",
      "body": [
        "驗算 $x=1$：",
        "遮住法只給最高次那項；其他的用比較係數補"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\frac{1}{x(x+1)^2}=\\frac1x-\\frac{1}{x+1}-\\frac{1}{(x+1)^2}",
        "\\text{左}=\\frac{1}{1\\cdot4}=\\frac14,\\qquad\\text{右}=1-\\frac12-\\frac14=\\frac14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 積分：只有一次方是 $\\ln$",
      "body": [
        "一次方：",
        "$k\\ge2$：冪次公式（$u=x-a$）",
        "例：$\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{dx}{(x+1)^2}=\\frac{(x+1)^{-1}}{-1}=-\\frac{1}{x+1}+C$",
        "回到 ② 那一題：",
        "微分驗算：$\\frac1x-\\frac1{x+1}-\\frac1{(x+1)^2}$，跟拆開的樣子一樣"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int\\frac{A}{x-a}\\,dx=A\\ln|x-a|+C",
        "\\int\\frac{A}{(x-a)^k}\\,dx=\\frac{A\\,(x-a)^{-k+1}}{-k+1}+C",
        "\\begin{aligned}&\\int\\frac{dx}{x(x+1)^2}\\\\&=\\ln|x|-\\ln|x+1|+\\frac{1}{x+1}+C\\end{aligned}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 定積分",
      "body": [
        "分子湊 $x+1$：$x=(x+1)-1$",
        "也可以設 $\\frac{A}{x+1}+\\frac{B}{(x+1)^2}$，得 $A=1$、$B=-1$",
        "反導函數：$\\ln(x+1)+\\dfrac{1}{x+1}$",
        "$[0,1]$ 上 $x+1>0$，被積函數連續，可以用微積分基本定理"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_0^1\\frac{x}{(x+1)^2}\\,dx",
        "\\frac{x}{(x+1)^2}=\\frac{1}{x+1}-\\frac{1}{(x+1)^2}",
        "\\Big[\\ln(x+1)+\\frac{1}{x+1}\\Big]_0^1=\\Big(\\ln2+\\frac12\\Big)-\\Big(0+1\\Big)",
        "=\\ln2-\\frac12\\approx0.193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 只有一個重複因式：換元",
      "body": [
        "令 $u=x-1$：$x=u+1$，$dx=du$",
        "跟 ① 拆出來的 $\\frac{3}{x-1}+\\frac{4}{(x-1)^2}$ 完全一樣",
        "分母還有別的因式（如 $x(x+1)^2$）時，換元不會變簡單，還是用設、求、積"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int\\frac{3x+1}{(x-1)^2}\\,dx",
        "3x+1=3(u+1)+1=3u+4",
        "\\frac{3u+4}{u^2}=\\frac3u+\\frac{4}{u^2}",
        "\\int\\Big(\\frac3u+\\frac4{u^2}\\Big)du=3\\ln|u|-\\frac4u+C",
        "=3\\ln|x-1|-\\frac{4}{x-1}+C"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "重點整理",
